    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send a fax with human approval\nFax for Agents, https://faxforagents.com. REST API only, HTTP Request nodes with one **Bearer Auth** credential.\n\n**Before the first run** open any HTTP node and pick or create a Bearer Auth credential with your API key. A test key (`ffa_test_...`) reaches the sandbox, no carrier, no cost. Keys: https://app.faxforagents.com\n\nEdit **Fax input** for the destination and the text. Sandbox outcomes: `+15550000001` delivered, `+15550000003` partial, `+15550000005` unknown, `+15550000007` failed.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 860
      },
      "id": "f0a0f0a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "name": "Note 20",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The approvals rule\nA live send needs a human approval bound to this exact quote, or a delegated policy the account owner wrote. The workflow asks with `POST /v1/approval-requests` and polls every 30 seconds until a person decides. It can never approve its own send: an API key used by automation cannot carry `approval:decide`.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1060
      },
      "id": "f0a0f0a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
      "name": "Note 21",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## After the send\n`queued` is not delivered. The workflow polls `GET /v1/faxes/{id}` every 10 seconds until the carrier answers. `delivered` carries the carrier's evidence. `partial` and `unknown` stop here and a person reconciles, nothing retransmits on its own.\n\nPrice card launch-v1, effective 2026-10-28: $0.039 per page sent, $0.019 per page received. `amount_micro` is USD in micro-units (39000 is $0.039).",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 760
      },
      "id": "f0a0f0a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000022",
      "name": "Note 22",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2420,
        560
      ]
    }
